			(property "Description" "SOT23-5 Fixed Voltage Regulators\n\nTo better organise some of the SOT23-5 fixed voltage regulators in this library, this new part was created.\n\nPart Current Out V Out V In V Dropout Digikey Part No.     ADP121   150mA   3.3V   3.4-5.5V   0.09V @ 150mA   ADP121-AUJZ33R7CT-ND     ADP121   150mA   3.0V   3.1-5.5V   0.09V @ 150mA   ADP121-AUJZ30R7CT-ND     ADP122   300mA   3.3V   3.4-5.5V   0.085V @ 300mA   ADP122AUJZ-3.3-R7CT-ND     ADP1712   300mA   3.3V   3.5-5.5V   0.17V @ 300mA   ADP1712AUJZ-3.3-R7TR-ND     AP7311 (Low Cost)   150mA   3.3V   3.5-6V   0.15V @ 150mA   AP7311-33WG-7DICT-ND      LD39015M18R   150mA   1.8V   1.9V-5.5V   0.08V @ 100mA   497-6977-1-ND      MCP1824T-3302E/OT   300mA   3.3V   3.5V-6V   0.2V @ 300mA   MCP1824T-3302E/OTCT-ND      MIC5205-2.5YM5 TR   150mA   2.5V   2.7-16V   0.165V @ 150mA   576-1257-2-ND     MIC5205-3.0YM5 TR   150mA   3.0V   3.2V-16V   0.165V @ 150mA   576-1258-2-ND     MIC5205-3.3YM5 TR   150mA   3.3V   3.5V-16V   0.165V @ 150mA   576-1259-2-ND     TPS780330220   150mA   3.3V+2.2V   3.6-5.5V   250mV Max   296-23332-1-ND     TDA3663/N1,135   100mA   3.3V   3.5-45V   0.18V @ 50mA   568-5343-1-ND"
